   "i": 0,
   "text": "Blurry photos? Your phone guessed wrong.",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 2.414
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "Lesson two: tap to focus.",
   "start": 2.634,
   "end": 4.366
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "Auto focus guesses what matters, and it often picks the background.",
   "start": 4.586,
   "end": 8.184
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "So tap your subject on the screen, and it snaps sharp.",
   "start": 8.404,
   "end": 11.21
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "See that little sun? Slide it down",
   "start": 11.43,
   "end": 13.75
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "to save bright skies,",
   "start": 13.83,
   "end": 14.61
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "or up to brighten shadows.",
   "start": 14.8,
   "end": 16.24
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "Pro tip: press and hold to lock focus and exposure,",
   "start": 16.46,
   "end": 19.43
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "so it stays put while you reframe.",
   "start": 19.75,
   "end": 21.337
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "Follow for lesson three!",
   "start": 21.557,
   "end": 22.829
  }
 ]
